, 1Co.11:34; εἶναι ἐν τ αὐτῷ κ., Luk.23:40; with genitive obj., Rom.3:8, 1Ti.3:6, Rev.17:1; of God's judgment through Christ, Jhn.9:39; τὸ κ. ἄρχεται, 1Pe.4:17; τ. κ. τ. μέλλον, Act.24:25; κ. αἰώνιον, Heb.6:2; ἔκρινεν ὁ Θεὸς τ. κ. ὐμῶν, Rev.18:20; of the right of judgment, Rev.20:4. \n __2. a matter for judgment, a law-suit, a case: 1Co.6:7.†\n (AS)","source_line":3112}],"occurrence_count":27,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"condenação","count":11},{"gloss":"julgamento","count":9},{"gloss":"juízo","count":3},{"gloss":"juízos","count":1},{"gloss":"entre","count":1},{"gloss":"indignamente","count":1},{"gloss":"dela","count":1}]},"G3188":{"id":"G3188","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3188","disambiguated_id":"G3188 =","unique_id":"G3188","headword":"μέλαν","transliteration":"melan","lexical_morphology":"G:N-N","gloss_en":"ink","definition_en":"μέλαν, τό, see: μέλας.\n μέλας, -αινα, -αν genitive, -ανος, -αίνης, -ανος, \n [in LXX: Sng.1:5, Zec.6:2 (שָׁחֹר), etc. ;] \nblack: Rev.6:5, 12; opposite to λευκός, Mat.5:36; neut., τὸ μ., ink : 2Co.3:3, II Jn 12, 3Jn.13.†\n (AS)","source_line":3400}],"occurrence_count":3,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"tinta","count":3}]},"G3347":{"id":"G3347","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3347","disambiguated_id":"G3347 =","unique_id":"G3347","headword":"μετέπειτα","transliteration":"metepeita","lexical_morphology":"G:ADV","gloss_en":"afterward","definition_en":"μετ-έπειτα, \n adv. [in LXX: Jdth.9:5, Est.3:13, 3Ma.3:24 * ;] \nafter­wards: Heb.12:17.†\n (AS)","source_line":3460}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"quando","count":1}]},"G343":{"id":"G343","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0343","disambiguated_id":"G0343 =","unique_id":"G0343","headword":"ἀνακαλύπτω","transliteration":"anakaluptō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to unveil","definition_en":"ἀνα-καλύπτω \n [in LXX chiefly for גָּלָה ni., pi. ;] \nto unveil: metaphorically of removing hindrance to perce